&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket:&lt;/strong&gt; Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free snacks and drinks:&lt;/strong&gt; Indulge in a variety of free snacks and beverages to keep you fuelled throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Access via OpenUp the online support from certified psychologists and lifestyle experts at no cost to you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Isar Aerospace, we&#39;re building Europe&#39;s future in space. As an Intern within the talent attraction team, you will help us attract and hire the exceptional talent behind our launch vehicles and mission success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;From active sourcing and candidate engagement to interview coordination and recruiting analytics, you&#39;ll gain hands-on experience across the full hiring lifecycle while contributing directly to the growth of Europe&#39;s most ambitious aerospace company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunt the best candidates by actively sourcing on various channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screen applications and keep interviews on track by coordinating and scheduling with candidates and hiring managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support us with conducting first interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publish Job advertisements across our career page and job boards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Greenhouse, our applicant tracking system, sharp and up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get hands-on with talent attraction projects e.g. the setup of our KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support recruiting events to connect with future talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot what needs improvement and help fix it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled at a university, ideally studying business, psychology, HR, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First practical exposure to recruiting or HR (internship, working student role, or project work) is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with data to support reporting and KPI tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, reliable, and eager to learn in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work onsite at least 2 days / week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Greenhouse or another ATS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LinkedIn Recruiter or other sourcing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket:&lt;/strong&gt; Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free snacks and drinks:&lt;/strong&gt; Indulge in a variety of free snacks and beverages to keep you fuelled throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Access via OpenUp the online support from certified psychologists and lifestyle experts at no cost to you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;11626 - Associate Director, Partnerships, Global&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The primary role of the Partnerships Associate Director is to work to define and deliver cross channel, joint business partnership opportunities for some of our largest Global clients. This role will also work in tandem with Strategy leads and Account teams to identify relevant media partners, to then develop integrated investment strategies with, delivering best in class, progressive, strategic client partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director will work to support account Directors defining opportunities, briefs and leading day to day management of key client JBPs with media partners to maximise long term strategic partnership value and overall business outcomes for our clients.&amp;nbsp; Cooperation and co-ordination with local and regional market teams will be central to this, to ensure a consistent approach and successful execution of the negotiated and defined value benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will require high levels of coordination and organization as it will involve management of a complex client and agency structure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic and Leadership Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with relevant client agency departments e.g. Global Planning, Activation, measurement, creative and client servicing to deliver innovative Global JBP opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as global partnership day to day lead for client centric JBPs, working to identify, operationalise, co-create, and deliver best in market value and innovation for our brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of media landscape working closely with cross channel Global partners, to ensure first mover opportunities are leveraged for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in the development, negotiation, deployment and monitoring of Global JBPs across local and regional markets (per client structure) to ensure targets are met and value is unlocked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Account Management &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate an ability to build and maintain strong working relationships with clients, global media vendors, agency network and internal strategy teams, to drive collaboration and best in class delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and sell partnerships persuasively and with confidence, passion and enthusiasm to both clients and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating and Technical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver best in class JBPs ensuring client value, innovation and excellence are delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in the development of a global integrated investment strategy and then actively work with regional and local leads to deploy in markets, adapting as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global lead on media quality processes and governance and ensure same rigor applied to all media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain bi-weekly partner statuses and overall JBP governance ensuring workstreams are delivered and that there is relevant cross business engagement and utilization of programs, their benefits and overall value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively share global marketplace updates and work with markets to do the same with regular cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day to day vendor spend tracking and pacing requirements against agreed JBPs on key client ensuring correct framework is in place to hit spend thresholds across regions and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief and manage set up of client QBR and JBP reviews coordinating with regions and markets where required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalise quarterly leadership document development for clients ensuring best in class results and cross business case study sharing, outcome tracking and value extraction is highlighted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People/Team Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support day to day leadership requests from Partnerships Director and Global Head of Strategic Partnership lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with both clients as well as internally at across agencies and WPP Media teams, to ensure integration opportunities and relevant problem solving when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with media vendors across key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;771 - Associate Director Implementational Planning - UK&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Implementational Planning Associate Director, you drive day-to-day excellence in cross-channel media planning and activation. Translating client strategies (from Strategists/Comms Planners) into detailed implementational plans across all media (digital, audio, VOD, AV), you ensure seamless execution and measurable brand/performance outcomes. You collaborate deeply with specialist teams, acting as a key client contact on media performance, aligning with OASIS (objective, audience, strategy, Implementation &amp;amp; scoring) framework within WPP Open. Responsibilities include cross-channel optimisation, media testing, leveraging WPP Open Intelligence for data, and coordinating PCA insights for future strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting Structure:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reports to Implementational Planning Business Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line Management:&amp;nbsp;Provide direct line management, mentorship, and development for junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Delivery &amp;amp; Management:&amp;nbsp;Act as the primary day-to-day client connection, delivering integrated planning and activation, developing and presenting implementational responses, and building strong client and partner relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Channel Planning:&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with Strategists and Comms Planners to translate overarching media strategies into detailed tactical plans across all channels, creating integrated roadmaps aligned with brand and performance goals. This process is aligned with OASIS framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimisation &amp;amp; Performance:&amp;nbsp;Lead cross-channel optimisation, implement advanced measurement (including media testing frameworks), refine plans based on data and audience insights, and coordinate insights for PCAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Capability:&amp;nbsp;Implement and test new tools, technologies (e.g., AI-driven optimisation) within client campaigns, utilising WPP Open and WPP Open Intelligence for data opportunities and testing initiatives, all within the context of the&amp;nbsp;DPAM framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Collaboration:&amp;nbsp;Foster cross-functional collaboration with Comms Planners, Strategists, and activation specialists, presenting a unified approach aligned with the OASIS framework&amp;nbsp;within the WPP Open ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in media planning, digital activation, or implementational planning, managing complex accounts and orchestrating integrated media strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in cross-channel planning (digital, audio, VOD, AV), strong data analysis, integrated media testing knowledge, and client relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate high-level brand and performance strategies, in partnership with Comms Planners and Strategists, into detailed, actionable tactical plans across the entire media mix, directly contributing to wider client media strategy, following the&amp;nbsp;OASIS framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of the full media landscape and core media buying platforms, with an understanding of how they intersect and integrate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of audience insights, advanced analytics, data validation, and the ability to leverage performance data for optimisation, including robust media testing frameworks and WPP Open Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in planning and optimisation tools (including WPP Open) and integrating AI-driven tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build trusted client relationships, present confidently, and manage expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, fostering productive working relationships across internal teams and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, innovative, and pioneering mindset, focused on continuous improvement, problem-solving, and passion for media testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Extraordinary by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an Open environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Optimistically by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a technically strong Junior Data Analyst to support Marketing Analytics by transforming data into insights that improve campaign performance and enable data &amp;amp; AI driven decision-making. This is an early-career role ideal for candidates with strong analytical fundamentals and hands-on experience with SQL, Python, Claude Code, and modern data platforms such as Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with large marketing datasets, develop reporting solutions, automate data workflows, implement AI agentic layers and partner with marketing business partners to deliver actionable insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze marketing performance data to identify trends, optimization opportunities, and key performance drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate customer acquisition, engagement, and conversion metrics to support marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement an intelligent lead ingestion framework by automating the lead import process using AI-driven data parsing, validation, and enrichment techniques. This includes building scalable process automation pipelines and developing a user-friendly interface that enables seamless monitoring, control, and interaction with incoming lead data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear insights and recommendations for stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ad-hoc analysis and proactively identify opportunities for deeper insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Data Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write efficient SQL queries to extract, transform, and analyze marketing and enterprise data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Python for data cleaning, automation, and exploratory analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with building and maintaining curated datasets, data models, and data quality checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Claude Code to design interfaces, agents &amp;amp; automation steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain dashboards and marketing performance reports using BI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate recurring reporting processes to improve efficiency and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing, analytics, data science and data engineering teams to support reporting and data needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document data definitions, logic, and reporting methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;id-📝JobDescription&amp;amp;JobPostGuidelines-WhatYou’llDo.1&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of SQL, including joins, aggregations, and data transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic to intermediate proficiency in Python with experience using data libraries (e.g., pandas, NumPy) through coursework, projects, or internships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Databricks, Apache Spark, or cloud-based data environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with real-world datasets and performing data validation and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong curiosity and willingness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities with attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate technical findings to non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple workflow priorities using Jira or similar project management tools and work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Data Analytics, Computer Science, Statistics, Business Analytics, Marketing Analytics, or related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, academic project, or research experience involving data analysis is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Tableau, Power BI, or similar visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with marketing analytics concepts or campaign performance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to marketing platforms such as Google Analytics or Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using version control tools (e.g., Git)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of ETL or data pipeline concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with large-scale marketing and customer datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; development in SQL, Python, Databricks and modern analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to influence marketing strategy through data insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cloud-based analytics and data engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong career development foundation in data analytics and marketing analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cutting-edge AI-assisted development tools, including Claude Code, empowering you to accelerate analysis &amp;amp; prototype solutions rapidly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
