&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£103,390&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£129,220 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come and join us in London!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are looking for an IT Technical Support Specialist to for our IT Service Desk in London to support our employees and the Autonomous Vehicle operation in London&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY ADVENTURES WILL INCLUDE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Hero of Technical Support!&lt;/strong&gt; Provide expert Level 1 &amp;amp; 2 support on-site and remotely, using diagnostic techniques and smart problem-solving to resolve complex issues across SaaS applications, OS environments, and hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power Up Automation!&lt;/strong&gt; Advance our &quot;infrastructure as code&quot; strategy by designing and implementing automation workflows in JIRA, scripting, or low-code environments like Workato, Zapier, or Okta Workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make IT Effortless!&lt;/strong&gt; Fine-tune self-service tools, manage identity and access lifecycles across platforms, and proactively implement IT solutions that save time and effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep Office Infrastructure Connected!&lt;/strong&gt; Support and troubleshoot network connectivity (WAN/LAN/Wi-Fi, VPN, routing) and assist with essential on-site server asset maintenance to ensure seamless daily operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Bridge Between IT &amp;amp; People!&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with teams across the company (such as HR and IT Solutions) to improve onboarding, IT services, and workflow automation, providing clear communication to technical and non-technical users alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate &amp;amp; Drive Lifecycle Management!&lt;/strong&gt; Identify process bottlenecks, optimize SaaS tools, and oversee hardware inventory lifecycles from acquisition to technical provisioning for employee devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO BE SUCCESSFUL IN THIS ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; 3 to 5+ years of experience in an IT Service Desk role within a SaaS or fast-paced startup/hyper-growth environment, with a strong ability to systematically diagnose complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; IT Efficiency is key!&lt;/strong&gt; A strong passion for improving IT processes through low-code/no-code platforms and scripting in Bash, Python, or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to effectively communicate technical solutions to both IT and non-technical teams, with proficiency in tools like Google Workspace, Slack, and Zoom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Cross-Team Coordination!&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with HR, IT Solutions, and other departments to enhance IT service delivery, leveraging Atlassian tools like JIRA and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive &amp;amp; Self-Driven!&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of tasks, make independent decisions on advanced technical support issues, and suggest continuous improvements to our IT infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Completed training as an IT specialist for system integration (&lt;em&gt;Fachinformatiker für Systemintegration&lt;/em&gt;), a Specialized Diploma, or a comparable qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ticket &amp;amp; Process Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with JIRA and Confluence for ticket tracking, issue management, and process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with Identity Providers such as Okta, Azure AD, OneLogin, and Active Directory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS &amp;amp; Workspace Administration:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in managing, administering, and troubleshooting Google Workspace and core SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Device Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with MDM solutions for managing and provisioning macOS, Windows, and iOS devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Networking &amp;amp; Connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Working familiarity with network architecture and troubleshooting (WAN/LAN/Wi-Fi, VPN, routing) to support office environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Scripting:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in scripting using Bash, Python, or utilizing low-code/no-code platforms (Workato, Zapier, Okta Workflows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to write clear and concise technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
