&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh serves millions of customers weekly across 18 business units and 8 brands worldwide. At the heart of our product is a belief that every customer deserves a menu that feels like it was made for them, the right meals, at the right time, for the right person. We call it the Sous Chef vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Senior PM II on the Personalization Experience team&lt;/strong&gt;, you own what makes that vision real and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;felt&lt;/em&gt;. You&#39;re not building the ranking algorithm, you&#39;re building the experiences that make customers trust it, the data collection that makes it smart, and the moments where someone thinks: &lt;em&gt;this app actually knows me&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-autonomy role at the intersection of consumer UX, engineering, and ML systems. The problems are genuinely hard, the scale is real, and the decisions are yours to make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food Profile Quality &amp;amp; Signal Collection:&lt;/strong&gt; The food profile is the raw material that powers everything downstream. Your job is to move customers from &quot;fields filled in&quot; to truly Personalization-Ready: high-signal, validated, actionable. You&#39;ll own and iterate on the collection experiences that give our models the data they need to perform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &quot;Sous Chef&quot; Feel &amp;amp; Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt; You build the moments where personalization becomes tangible, the places where we tell customers &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; certain meals were chosen for them. This isn&#39;t just UX work, it&#39;s trust infrastructure for the entire personalization stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Org Data Supplier&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;re the clean, reliable interface between raw signal and downstream experience, owning the explanation payloads and API contracts that make it all work at scale. You operate across organizational boundaries and align on shared metrics without needing to own the surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Discovery&lt;/strong&gt; You use GenAI tools actively to compress discovery-to-decision cycles, synthesizing global customer signals, stress-testing hypotheses, and arriving at decision-ready specs faster than traditional PM workflows allow. You don&#39;t treat AI as a novelty; it&#39;s a genuine speed and quality multiplier in your daily practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long-Horizon Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; You manage your domain with real autonomy. You run a flywheel: better profile data → better models → more visible personalization → more signal back to personalization. You own the strategy and sequencing, not just the backlog, thinking 12–18 months out and making the calls that shape the direction of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep personalization or data-collection PM experience.&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of PM experience, with meaningful time on user-facing personalization or data collection products, ideally where the UX &lt;em&gt;is&lt;/em&gt; the data pipeline, and where you&#39;ve shipped for both end customers and downstream data consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product taste and customer-facing craft.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a genuine feel for what makes a consumer experience compelling, trustworthy, and sticky, not just functional. You&#39;ve built products at scale where millions of people interact with what you ship, and you hold a high bar for the details: the copy, the interaction pattern, the moment of delight. You know the difference between a feature that works and one that earns trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-native.&lt;/strong&gt; You query your own data (SQL/Python), define your own input/output KPIs, and hold your own in deep-dive technical discussions without needing a data analyst to translate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-org credibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve shipped products across organizational boundaries, aligning on shared metrics, maintaining clean contracts with engineering partners, and navigating competing priorities without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation with healthy skepticism.&lt;/strong&gt; You design experiments to validate hypotheses and know how to interpret results without over-indexing on noise. You&#39;ve made hard calls to kill features based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; You can make a complex algorithmic concept legible to a non-technical VP and you can write a spec that engineers can actually ship from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI edge.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve already incorporated AI-assisted workflows into your daily practice to increase speed, depth of insight, and output quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, data is at the heart of everything we do — from the moment a customer places an order to the way we forecast demand, optimize our supply chain, and personalize experiences for millions of people. Making that data fast, reliable, and available is what our Data Platform makes possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Operational Data Platform&lt;/strong&gt; team — the squad that ensures operational data is created, delivered, and shared downstream reliably, cost-efficiently, and with the quality guarantees that everything downstream depends on — so the analytics layer receives quality data, ready to be turned into governed assets. You will build the streaming, messaging, and self-service provisioning systems that hundreds of backend and data engineers rely on every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role at the core of our platform. You&#39;ll own critical infrastructure, drive efficiency, and help define the &quot;golden path&quot; that makes it effortless for engineers across the company to store and stream their data — with governance and cost control built in from the start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run our streaming and messaging platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the systems that move data in real time and at scale — Kafka, Kafka Connect, Flink, and SQS — and keep them fast, resilient, and easy to build on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive efficiency.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and act on opportunities to reduce the cost and complexity of the platform, and make efficiency a default rather than an afterthought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the reliability of critical data paths.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep the systems at the heart of the platform highly available, and continuously improve their resilience, observability, and operational maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable self-service for operational data stores.&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain the Terraform modules and tooling that let engineering teams use the right database for their use case within minutes, with governance and cost guardrails out of the box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build AI-powered self-service.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop tooling — including AI and agent-based capabilities — that lets teams operate and maintain their own data infrastructure, so the platform runs without us in the loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on data quality&lt;/strong&gt; for operational data, including data quality checks on Kafka, so downstream analytics can trust the data from the moment it&#39;s created.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across the platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with the Analytical Data team so high-quality operational data flows seamlessly into the analytics platform through clean, well-defined handover points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate what you build.&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in on-call rotations for the systems you own, and invest in automation so the platform runs without a human in the loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience as a &lt;strong&gt;data, software, or platform engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of building and operating production data infrastructure at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals and proficiency in a backend language (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Go, Java, Scala, or Python&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with &lt;strong&gt;event streaming and messaging systems&lt;/strong&gt; — Kafka in particular — including their operational characteristics in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;databases&lt;/strong&gt; (relational and NoSQL — e.g. PostgreSQL, MongoDB, DynamoDB) and the trade-offs between them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building infrastructure on &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; with infrastructure-as-code (&lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;), containers, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong ownership mindset — you care about reliability, efficiency, and the developer experience of the teams you serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with &lt;strong&gt;on-call responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt; and a bias toward automating away toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate across engineering teams to design seamless, composable services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Flink&lt;/strong&gt;, stream processing, Kafka Connect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building &lt;strong&gt;self-service developer platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data lake architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
